{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>大埔發生撞船意外。今日（28日）晚上9時32分，大埔漁安街7號一間船廠附近，據報有兩艘舢舨相撞。</p><p>意外中，兩船上共有6名男子受傷，據悉全部獲救清醒。警方現正調查事件起因。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130610502100062208086957.jpeg/0jkW8K2ZHbBksFYfJNHOaeXOOSvA2SAD-gQCK_oEAis\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-28T13:59:02.318406+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}